 forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"En footing, l’objectif est aussi de faire bosser ton cardio. Certaines adaptations importantes n’arrivent qu’à une allure lente, alors respecte ce rythme : c’est essentiel pour progresser efficacement !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":329,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":329}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_30+4LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Vas-y doucement sur l'endurance fondamentale sur cette sortie. Aucune fatigue ne doit être générée et les lignes droites finales ne sont là que pour garder le corps habitué à une grande amplitude de mouvement (en endurance fondamentale, tous les gestes sont \"restreints\" pour garder l'allure basse, on vient rééquilibrer ça avec les lignes droites)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_26","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":329,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":26,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":212,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":342,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1785715200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1560,"pace":{"value":329}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":342}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - REPRISE  - SEMAINE 2 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier bloc est composé de 4 séries de 5 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second bloc est composé de 3 séries de 3 