ur que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Tu veux progresser ? Ça passe par ces footings bien lents pendant les semaines de récupération alors ne cours pas plus vite, tu auras l'occasion de te fatiguer à nouveau la semaine prochaine rassure-toi !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_35+6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Comme l'indique la description de l'entrainement, si tu te sens très fatigué(e), n'hésite pas à supprimer les lignes droites et rentre directement te reposer ! Elles sont optionnelles, pour garder le corps habitué à des intensités très élevées, mais le principal est de ne pas générer de fatigue inutile ici.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_29","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":29,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":211,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":340,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1740,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":340}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 3 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 4 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 4 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause à la spécifité que les durées et répétitions diminuent de série en série et que l'intensité diminue. Prend 2'  de récupération entre les séries. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Le renforcement est un complément à la course, pas une compétition. Le lendemain de ta séance, tu ne dois pas être cassé en deux (même sur les séances les plus difficiles). Alors si tu te sens épuisé, n'hésite pas à utiliser une variante d'exercice plus simple sur quelques répétitions par série.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":12,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"sWHMMIyy4h2UCt1nRa02ESjPpivqnf018d","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"dic02Ysz02AmD200oMRCvd900hIc3lw01Jh85","format":"desktop"}