n 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 4 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 4 séries de 4 exercices enchainés sans pause. Prend 2' de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1, et 1' entre les séries du bloc 2. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Même si les intensités les plus hautes de la séance, n'oublions pas que le renforcement est au service de la course à pied et non à son détriment. Si tu vois que tu as trop de courbatures ou de fatigue le lendemain soit tu peux laisser plus de récupération, soit tu peux diminuer l'intensité de la séance.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":10,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"sWHMMIyy4h2UCt1nRa02ESjPpivqnf018d","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"dic02Ysz02AmD200oMRCvd900hIc3lw01Jh85","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/173039339